## Similar project 3: Every noise analysis
https://github.com/sofielange98/every-noise-network-analysis

### What is useful for our project
- It shows that multiple Spotify audio features can be used together to compare songs and genres.
- K-Means clustering can help us see whether songs naturally form groups instead of relying only on genre labels.
- Correlation analysis can help us understand which audio features are related before clustering.
- The clustering approach may help us explore possible subgenres within our dataset.
- Similarity between clusters could also be useful later for song recommendations.

